--- !u!114 &1167868208
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1167868206}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7cdaee43ffca7cb4ba1aba307f7d4c1b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttons:
  - {fileID: 1464183884}
  - {fileID: 452860373}
  - {fileID: 1402429254}
  - {fileID: 946570519}
  - {fileID: 306915979}
  - {fileID: 620808167}
  texts:
  - Here you get the random amount of notebooks, items, etc.
  - Choose the custom settings of the game, like manage the amount of notebooks.
  - It's just you and Baldi in this challenge. The catch is, both of you move super
    fast! Can you think fast enough to collect 9 notebooks and escape the school?
  - You've snuck in school after hours! Surely Principal of the Things will be after
    you. Use invisible potions (7 seconds each), lockers, and your map to avoid being
    seen and collect 7 notebooks.
  - You're legs might be broken, but thankfully you're equipped with an infinite
    use grappling hook! See if you can outwit Baldi and his friends when this is
    your only way to move!
  - Woah! A crazy glitch has taken over the school! Can you beat this supper challenge?!
    Cheats are now available!
  text: {fileID: 933013685}
