  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttons:
  - {fileID: 1853463600}
  - {fileID: 1240670753}
  - {fileID: 1091259101}
  - {fileID: 275356709}
  - {fileID: 256578057}
  - {fileID: 1637472337}
  - {fileID: 1021188035}
  texts:
  - Play as you normally do, as well as giving yourself a challenge.
  - Experience the Grand Opening schoolhouse! All events and stories will continue
    from here now on.
  - Go to the camp with Baldi. Collect firewoods and survive the night!
  - Go to the farm with Baldi. Reach the flag from the maze, or find the missing
    animals from the Barn!
  - A real game of hide and seek turned into a mode! Hide from Baldi or catch him
    from this fun minigame!
  - Play as <color=red>BALDI</color> or <color=#00ffff>COOPERATIVELY</color> play
    with friends in the classic schoolhouse. Join in the fun!
  - All presents are wrapped in the school! Have fun on Baldi's party!
  text: {fileID: 2106001297}
